<title>POLAND: GPRD 1996 net rises to PLN 7.1 mln.</title>
<headline>GPRD 1996 net rises to PLN 7.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>GPRD SA results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	  1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			11.80 vs    8.16</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  11.02 vs    7.70</p>
<p>    net profit				 7.07 vs    4.62</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Gdanskie Przedsiebiorstwo Robot Drogowych SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				134.41 vs   81.95</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 117.18 vs   68.91</p>
<p>    extraordinary			    0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 2.93 vs    2.46</p>
<p>    other taxes				1.02 vs    0.62</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.83 vs    0.42</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.61 vs    0.89</p>
<p>    investment				16.40 vs    4.35</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
